              <span class="tag is-light is-size-7"><a class="" href="https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.AFT.2025.35">10.4230/LIPIcs.AFT.2025.35 <i class="fa fa-external-link" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
            </div>
