        BLIP3o-NEXT: Next Frontier of Native Image Generation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+J">Jiuhai Chen</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xue%2C+L">Le Xue</a>, 
      
